Attribution
-----------

Valence's architecture was informed by two open projects:

  MarkText and Muya (MIT, https://github.com/marktext/marktext).
  No MarkText or Muya source code is included in this repository. Its
  architecture was studied and deliberately diverged from; specifically,
  the operational-transform model, the snabbdom-over-contenteditable
  reconciler, and the hand-written inline lexer are not reproduced here.

Typora is proprietary. No Typora code is used. Its documented behaviour was
reimplemented from public documentation.

Third-party runtime dependencies retain their own licences; run
`pnpm licenses list` for the full set.